codex
I also audited the claimed 208-operation shortcut itself. Randomizing which Walsh characters carry the coordinate equations adds character-identification work that the first count omitted. I’m tightening the shipping dimension from 16 to 15 (still in the paper’s tested range, with 32 overdefining equations), so the fully counted route is 297 field operations—inside the 300-operation cap without hand-waving.
